	<property name="DegradeItemsOnDeath"			value="none"/>	<!-- Death Degradation. Sets whether items degrade on death. None = No loss. Durability = Reduces an amount of current durability, which can be repaired. Max Durability = Reduces maximum durability, lowering the repair cap. Both = Items lose both current and maximum durability. Default: none. Values: none, durability, max durability, both -->
